# Glimmer Seeker, Survival: "At the beginning of your second main phase, if this creature is tapped, draw a card if you control a
# Glimmer creature. If you don't control a Glimmer creature, create a 1/1 white Glimmer enchantment creature token." The Seeker
# (a Human Survivor, no Glimmer) is cast on turn 1 and attacks on turn 3: tapped at the second main phase, Bot1 controls no Glimmer, so
# it makes the 1/1 Glimmer token and draws nothing. On turn 5 it attacks again: now it controls a Glimmer creature (the token), so
# it draws a card (Lightning Bolt) and makes no second token.

